<view class="page"><view class="headline"><text>发现可信机构</text><text>投资机构、FA 与政府招商主体统一展示，先看公开资料，再发起对接。</text></view><scroll-view scroll-x class="filters"><text wx:for="{{types}}" wx:key="*this" class="filter {{activeType === item ? 'active' : ''}}" data-type="{{item}}" bindtap="chooseType">{{item}}</text></scroll-view><view class="result-count">共 {{filtered.length}} 家机构</view><view class="organization card" wx:for="{{filtered}}" wx:key="id"><view class="organization-top"><view class="avatar">{{item.name.slice(0, 1)}}</view><view class="organization-title"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.region}}</text></view><text class="tag">已认证</text></view><text class="tagline">{{item.tagline}}</text><text class="summary">{{item.description}}</text><view class="tags"><text wx:for="{{item.focus}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text></view></view></view>
